The app, dock, tray, and hero artwork in this directory and its
subdirectories (including but not limited to PNG, ICO, and SVG files) is
**NOT** covered by this repository's source-code license (AGPL-3.0).

These files are derived from the ClawAd mascot (pixel lobster), an original
character created for ClawAd. They are generated from
`themes/clawad/assets/` by `scripts/export-app-icons.js`; the generator
script is source code and stays under AGPL-3.0, while its artwork output —
the files in this directory — does not.

You may NOT copy, modify, distribute, or use this artwork without explicit
written permission, except for personal use of the ClawAd application as
distributed by this project.

This artwork is ClawAd's own work and is unrelated to the artwork of the
upstream fork (clawd-on-desk), which was not imported into this repository
(see `FORK.md` §2).

